  "description": "The site comprises a two story building with off street vehicular parking provisions as Commercial Units of Use Class E.\n\nA Retrospective planning permission ('Section 73A') based on its legislative reference, is submitted for the use of part of the off street vehicular parking area to the frontage of the site as a Hand Car Wash of Use Class Sui Generis category. The remaining six square meters of off street vehicular parking space will serve the Commercial Unit 1 on ground floor and no internal alterations to this unit are proposed as part of this submission.\n\nThe new external addition to the existing building comprises a light weight metal canopy covering part of the vehicular parking area with signage to the facia of the canopy. There is no change to the main building internal or external and no change to the boundary metal fence fronting the Coppen Road.",
